---
import groupA from '../assets/decor/group-a.svg';
import groupB from '../assets/decor/group-b.svg';
import ficoAccentBr from '../assets/decor/fico-accent-br.svg';
import ficoTlBottom from '../assets/decor/fico-tl-bottom.svg';
---

<section class="gifts" id="regali">
	<img class="decor decor-tl-a" src={groupA.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
	<img class="decor decor-tl-b" src={groupB.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
	<img class="decor decor-br" src={ficoAccentBr.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
	<img class="decor decor-bl" src={ficoTlBottom.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

	<div class="connector">
		<span class="line"></span>
		<span class="dot">03</span>
	</div>

	<p class="eyebrow">ULTIMA TAPPA</p>
	<h2>Un pensiero per noi</h2>
	<p class="intro">
		La vostra presenza è già il regalo più bello. Se desiderate comunque farci un pensiero,
		potete scegliere tra la nostra lista nozze o un bonifico.
	</p>

	<div class="options">
		<div class="option">
			<p class="label">🎁 LISTA NOZZE</p>
			<p class="name">[Nome negozio / piattaforma]</p>
			<p class="detail">Trovate la nostra selezione di idee regalo al link dedicato.</p>
			<a class="cta" href="#">Vai alla lista</a>
		</div>
		<div class="option">
			<p class="label">💳 BONIFICO</p>
			<div class="iban">
				<p>IT00 X000 0000 0000 0000 0000 000</p>
			</div>
			<p class="detail">Intestato a: Rita [Cognome] e Carlo [Cognome]</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<p class="thanks">Grazie di cuore per essere parte del nostro giorno più bello.</p>
</section>

<style>
	.gifts {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 28px);
		background: var(--color-cream);
		overflow: clip;
		padding: 0 clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(72px, 10vw, 120px);
	}

	.connector {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.line {
		background: var(--color-purple);
		width: 4px;
		height: 56px;
	}

	.dot {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 64px;
		height: 64px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #fff;
		border: 3px solid var(--color-purple);
		color: var(--color-purple);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 20px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		color: var(--color-orange);
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		text-align: center;
		font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 52px);
	}

	.intro {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: #4d4059;
		font-size: 17px;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 46ch;
	}

	.options {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 28px;
		justify-content: center;
		padding-top: 8px;
	}

	.option {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		width: 340px;
		max-width: 100%;
		padding: 32px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: #fff;
	}

	.label {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-orange);
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
	}

	.name {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		font-size: 18px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.detail {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-body-on-white);
		font-size: 14px;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 34ch;
	}

	.cta {
		margin-top: 4px;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--color-cream);
		text-decoration: none;
		background: var(--color-orange);
		padding: 10px 22px;
		border-radius: 999px;
	}

	.iban {
		width: 100%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		background: var(--color-cream);
		border-radius: 14px;
		padding: 16px 20px;
	}

	.iban p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		font-size: 15px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.thanks {
		margin: 8px 0 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-orange);
		font-size: 15px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.decor {
		position: absolute;
		pointer-events: none;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.decor-tl-a,
	.decor-tl-b {
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 70px;
	}

	.decor-br {
		bottom: 40px;
		right: 20px;
		width: clamp(90px, 10vw, 130px);
	}

	.decor-bl {
		bottom: -40px;
		left: -50px;
		width: clamp(140px, 15vw, 200px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.decor {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
